# Architecture and documentation first

Before implementing any feature, bugfix, or refactor in this repo:

1. **Read `docs/README.md`** — pick the docs relevant to the task (architecture, routes, components, API, auth, database, etc.).
2. **Follow existing patterns** — match how similar pages, API routes, and services are already built.
3. **Do not invent parallel structures** when the project already has a convention.

## Role skills (load the matching one before designing)

| Task | Skill |
|------|-------|
| Where new work belongs, trust boundaries, new table/route/dependency, trade-offs | `.cursor/skills/solutions-architect/SKILL.md` |
| Pages, components, client/server boundary, forms, metadata, loading states | `.cursor/skills/tech-lead-frontend/SKILL.md` |
| API routes, services, Supabase/Stripe, RLS, migrations, webhooks, rate limits | `.cursor/skills/tech-lead-backend/SKILL.md` |
| Spacing, gutters, mobile layout, visual review | `.cursor/skills/senior-ui-ux/SKILL.md` |

Skills are mirrored to `.claude/skills/` for Claude Code. **`.cursor/skills/` is the
source of truth** — edit there, then run `npm run skills:sync`. CI fails if the
two trees diverge.

## Architecture checklist

| Layer | Location | Pattern |
|-------|----------|---------|
| Public pages | `src/app/{route}/page.tsx` | Server component + `RootLayout` + `PageIntro` + `Container` |
| Auth API | `src/app/api/auth/` or `src/app/auth/` | Thin routes; logic in `src/lib/` or `src/server/services/` |
| Business logic | `src/server/services/` | Functions receive Supabase/Stripe clients as params |
| Shared UI | `src/components/` | Reuse `Button`, `FadeIn`, `PageIntro`, form patterns |
| Spacing | `src/lib/spacing.ts` | `PAGE_INTRO_Y`, `SECTION_Y`, `AFTER_INTRO_Y`, `BAND_PT`, `GUTTER_X` — see skill `senior-ui-ux` |
| Utils / constants | `src/lib/` | `site-url.ts`, `metadata.ts`, `auth.ts`, etc. |
| SQL | `supabase/migrations/` | Numbered, idempotent migrations |
| Auth emails | `supabase/templates/` | Click-to-confirm links via `/signup/confirm` and `/confirm` (see `supabase-auth` rule) |

## Page shell (marketing / account)

```tsx
<RootLayout>
  <PageIntro eyebrow="..." title="...">
    <p>...</p>
  </PageIntro>
  <Container className="mt-24 sm:mt-32 lg:mt-40">
    {/* content */}
  </Container>
</RootLayout>
```

Reference: `src/app/checkout/success/page.tsx`, `src/app/login/page.tsx`.

## Private / auth pages

- Export `metadata` with `robots: NO_INDEX_ROBOTS` from `@/lib/metadata`.
- Add route to `robots.ts` disallow list when it is account-only.

## After coding

- Run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, and `npm test` when touching logic.
- Update the matching doc in `docs/` if behavior or routes changed.
